{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_title", "source_sha256": "4a2e27cecf6ca08668e025dceacbbbe94b2e9046cd675038bab8a9b79a7752eb", "ja": "BRAND NEW PERFORM@NCE!!! 幕間2", "zh": "BRAND NEW PERFORM@NCE!!! 幕间2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3fd23206a190d08190ec1c43970b2da19d917f94d640b1ac9391a914bc08f951", "ja": "『BRAND NEW PERFORM@NCE!!!』\n公演ラストのアンコールを目前に控えた\nアイドルたちと事務員の一幕です。", "zh": "『BRAND NEW PERFORM@NCE!!!』\n这是即将迎来演出最后的安可时，\n偶像们与事务员的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "011a1b089ad735c9bcfd77c162541791b23aeee9f1e2f36f1779911b95340083", "ja": "美咲です！　お手伝いに来ました！", "zh": "我是美咲！我来帮忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b06657857468d993d889b2453319ea7284fa27289d2fd87c796397d83eb12bb", "ja": "あっ、美咲さん！\n静香ちゃんが、あっちで……。", "zh": "啊，美咲小姐！\n静香她在那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "2a99631c07df99bfe0fcfc1607010b2e635156199d1d65e9090226cfb9c69abf", "ja": "美咲さん、ごめんなさい！\nちょっと、手伝ってもらえますか？", "zh": "美咲小姐，对不起！可以请你帮个忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "e87495816770c69365f1c70817cc691288883cbea6fc9915bc42b4bd7001f6db", "ja": "はーい！　翼ちゃんたちも、\nもうちょっとだけ待っててね。", "zh": "好——！翼，还有大家，再稍微等一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a6f8e78b33c89fded7153fbe640de8c61c4bb6ef73f711f9798482e90f4f8a6b", "ja": "……静香ちゃん、お待たせ！", "zh": "……静香，让你久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "9cea7a3e7b1fb229d9ef3dc2715c25ea1a7f577c89a1eca5d48f22f9be42bf2a", "ja": "美咲ちゃんってホント、いい子よね～。\nテキパキ動いて、素直で可愛くて……。", "zh": "美咲真是个好孩子呢～。做事利落，又老实又可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "347613d77e4d11e35496dc17b3adda86f6dd14e628da8044cdb9792da55246f5", "ja": "しかも最近は、このライブのために\n毎日頑張ってくれてたしな。", "zh": "而且最近，为了这场演唱会，她每天都在努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0055ec7a8c945d5a9410bf0e2e3ac4e54f49e9d3274651c335af52adc7198698", "ja": "そーだ！　ライブが終わったら、美咲さんも誘って\nみんなでご飯にいきましょうよ～！", "zh": "对啦！演出结束后，把美咲小姐也叫上，大家一起去吃饭吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6ceac3fd897be9ff272e241140d12d652fe21e6f8e8a40c7f9292608510ee99", "ja": "わたし、ステーキが食べたいな♪", "zh": "我想吃牛排♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "0c3f302e80810ccdce51960efc37e63f830647adeba58149c894aed5ca7ada76", "ja": "あら、いいわね！　お酒……は、置いといて。\nみんなで行けるおいしいお店、リサーチしておくわ♪", "zh": "哎呀，挺不错的呢！酒嘛……就先放一边。\n我去调查一下大家能一起去的好吃店铺哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86bb10594e4b29a5ed7f27fc26c3ef0586be495da73682ffa9fe9c60ee3e0975", "ja": "やった～！　よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "太好啦～！那就拜托您啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2000_046rio", "source_sha256": "6345121eff7bed266b3d343d09e40d40ab223f5e4fa1ab8933f1cfe7a4670e4e", "ja": "それにしても…今回のライブは「新しいパフォーマンス\nを見せるんだ！」って、みんな頑張ったわよね～。", "zh": "话说回来……这次的演出，大家都为了“要展现全新的表演！”而努力了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a070126e7a22e66c395e64005a2b11f9f261a75dd13e12350f3661aec1e50af", "ja": "そうそう！　ジュリアーノの弾き語りとか、\nとってもカッコよかったですよね～。", "zh": "对对！茱莉亚——诺的自弹自唱之类的，真的帅极了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2002_050jul", "source_sha256": "e72474581cf4a48c835707142acd617f74ba4a591ee9047b616974a35f848727", "ja": "ま、まあ……あの曲は、あたしにとっても\n難しいチャレンジだったんだけどな。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那首歌对我来说，也是个很难的挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "44b4b5cfb53724356826d8d2d77f15c24de6a26a3634d32e5422e1293cfcaede", "ja": "でもさ。これを乗り越えたことで、新しいあたしの\n音楽が見つかったような気がするんだ……。", "zh": "不过啊，正因为跨过了这道难关，我感觉自己好像找到了全新的音乐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2004_046rio", "source_sha256": "06dc8713927b32dda8f09e17d003d4bf753c6dceac46a35ff755eab2f40e2677", "ja": "へえ～～♪", "zh": "欸～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "06dc8713927b32dda8f09e17d003d4bf753c6dceac46a35ff755eab2f40e2677", "ja": "へえ～～♪", "zh": "欸～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2006_050jul", "source_sha256": "98d0622602293428d127317b2804a62d919518a93742f8640c4dd565e0269f96", "ja": "な、なんだよ！　ニヤニヤしながらこっち見るな！！\nなんか、恥ずかしくなっちまうだろ！？", "zh": "干、干什么啊！别一脸坏笑地盯着我这边看！！\n搞得我都不好意思了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2007_046rio", "source_sha256": "e24dd856d13c81de4c4a60ab35085b42d97c0f3aeb2aceb73ef6c4f13049142f", "ja": "ごめんごめん！　音楽のこと真剣に語る\nジュリアちゃんが、なんだか可愛くって♪", "zh": "对不起对不起！认真聊音乐的\n茱莉亚，总觉得特别可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2008_050jul", "source_sha256": "c3a953458792d89ae40b3efa8f6666aff90ec96af8169e8e53ab58db2ae04f21", "ja": "くぅ……！\nもういい、忘れてくれ！　今のなし！", "zh": "呜……！\n算了，忘了吧！刚才那些不算！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c845d5518e167cb0871047e834e71169f78c77921776bab67e7abc1a6fbf1c49", "ja": "え～、ホントにかっこよかったのに～。\nあ、プロデューサーさん発見！", "zh": "诶～明明真的很帅气嘛～。\n啊，发现制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab13e2b21f54008321257c727cc693046965028002f814dbdc21655b92ecfcdd", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、プロデューサーさん！\nジュリアーノのステージ、かっこよかったですよね？", "zh": "制作人先生！\n茱莉亚的舞台很帅气，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2011", "source_sha256": "c9b2a5becfab2eb4ff9f44c1a6787207a22f0605b3d3be2640753ee24dd60794", "ja": "かっこよかった", "zh": "很帅气", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2100_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9cc5337f691a1b0a51b27a491ec181d2b7536a484260608bf56b03a25cf6fc2e", "ja": "ほらね！\nだからジュリアーノ、自信持って！", "zh": "看吧！所以，茱莉亚，要有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2101_050jul", "source_sha256": "069525efe173c75d72588fbd73939f79bf542c792d5e69656915cf4b386b8295", "ja": "バカPにも聞かれてたのかよ……。\nはいはい、サンキューな！", "zh": "连笨蛋制作人也听到了吗……  \n好啦好啦，谢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2102_050jul", "source_sha256": "a489a6a1a19eef449d4245e8d5ae33cd85bf7b65b8311cf4e72f72e6e82d4aeb", "ja": "でも、そういう莉緒姉だって、まるで演劇みたいな\nパフォーマンスでさ。最高にクールだったぜ？", "zh": "不过，莉绪姐你那如同戏剧般的表演，也帅到极点了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2103_046rio", "source_sha256": "ac7914558070a109f6c5d93679e8d9a89f6c9f5403a329f8c6447925bb920adf", "ja": "えっ、私に振るワケ！？　ま、まあ……\nあの曲も、ホント大変だったわ。", "zh": "诶，要我来吗！？嘛、也是……\n那首歌真的也很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2104_046rio", "source_sha256": "b53bedcdf524c45069e447eb8b7f20db7e01b97a8c510541fe5c9fbae1dc7cee", "ja": "夜想令嬢のみんなと色々考えて話し合って、\nそれこそ夜が明けるまで練習したりして……。", "zh": "我和夜想令嬢的大家一起想了好多、商量了好多，\n甚至还一直练习到了天亮呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2105_016tsu", "source_sha256": "deeed2de1401362e00c8f58d09be6d197d723912638c95f06159afce368b20ec", "ja": "へ～、大変そう……。", "zh": "诶～，听起来很辛苦呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2106_046rio", "source_sha256": "d96664065debd51454cd4649136426c72abc7edd3c2537e60fe0a777f2ce9155", "ja": "せっかく頑張ったお芝居だし、\nちゃんと物語の魅力が伝わってたらいいんだけど……", "zh": "既然是费了好大劲排演的戏，要是能把故事的魅力好好传达出去就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2107_046rio", "source_sha256": "fb10a371095a8f48ac01596241f3ca4add6dfdcf8c8c4e1b7856c05e89b76dba", "ja": "ねえ、プロデューサーくん。\nあの物語の魅力、ちゃんと伝わってたかしら？", "zh": "呐，制作人君。\n那个故事的魅力，有好好传达给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2108", "source_sha256": "18b5a6175112aca5a94e08db8036c37a2c38c8bea172a59fe3e0879c9abfc6bb", "ja": "伝わった", "zh": "传达到了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_2200_046rio", "source_sha256": "696b1601916b00252a43bb0941594dbed8a50c2dd34f5890e804377c44b3b3ec", "ja": "ホント？　よかった～、安心したわ！\nふふっ、プロデューサーくん、ありがと♪", "zh": "真的？太好了～这下我就放心了！\n呵呵，制作人君，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_004_bnpl02_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_004_bnpl02_01_4000_050jul", "source_sha256": "fad4075ba356e116dc7195e1c74c1e4a005c858b68f527a6139a679dbd50f2b1", "ja": "それにしても……\nシズ、結構時間かかってるな？", "zh": "不过话说回来……\n\n静香，花的时间还真不少啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
